[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i69"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我按掉了枕边的闹钟。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好久没用过闹钟了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然放暑假的时候基本用不上闹钟，可今天绝对不能迟到。"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“早上好。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11546"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“早上好。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11549"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“唉？今天起的真早啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，算是吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“要出门吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是的。我今天打算去出岛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11617"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“不是自己一个人吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，跟紬和静久她们一起。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11635"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“哦，这样啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"镜子打开包开始翻找起来。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11546"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“这是帮忙整理遗物的工钱。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？不用了，这多不好意思。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明就没怎么帮过忙。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11549"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“那么，这笔钱就作为给那两位帮忙的报酬好了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“之前她们帮忙搬过台球台，就算是那时候的报酬。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11575"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“所以，这笔钱要为了她们两位使用哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"既然这么说那我就没法拒绝了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“明白了。那我会为了她们俩好好用这些钱的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11546"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“嗯。那么，要玩的开心哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好的。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i129"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13823"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“早上好，乳依里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，早上好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“紬呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13807"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯……是不是真的睡过头了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她还没有来吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13804"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但我们约好了，如果迟到的话就要摆出灿烂到让人害怕的笑容。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“毕竟今天是到岛外去的日子。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13846"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哈哈♪真是很期待呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“紬来了之后啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我们也要给她个灿烂到让人害怕的笑容。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13785"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……好热啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“都已经中午了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"原以为和静久一边说话一边等，很快紬就会来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"通知正午时刻的广播已经播放过了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13767"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“本来打算在岛外吃午饭……现在看来有点难了啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……不过毕竟也没具体定好要在哪吃午饭。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“也没什么关系吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13737"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯。毕竟我最在意的是布偶专卖店和泳衣专卖店。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13740"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“紬穿着泳衣的样子，真是令人期待♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嗯，我也非常的期待。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不管是我们三人一起出去玩这件事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还是之后一起去玩水的场景。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"早知道会这样，我就把自己的泳装带来了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13816"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“羽依里觉得穿什么样的泳衣比较好？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“比赛用泳衣吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13837"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13794"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“紬和比赛用泳衣……感觉会是相当有趣的搭配啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是不是，我是在说我自己。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13843"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13840"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13767"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……唉？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“男生用的哦。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“还没来啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明之前还那么期待……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13840"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“搞不好今天她在家里呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13843"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“姑且进灯塔看看如何？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“也是。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“之前也约好了，要是睡过头了就把她叫起来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽说在太阳照得到的地方，怎么着也不会睡到这个时间吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不对，不如说要能睡到现在反而让人觉得厉害了。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“打扰了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“紬，我们进来咯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i137"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13767"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“哎呀，好像不在里面呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“今天应该不是打算给我们惊喜了吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13804"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“果然是在家里？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“看起来是这样了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"既然紬不在灯塔里，那么我们还是回到灯塔前等着吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如果紬来了的话，肯定会坐在那个固定的位置。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i321"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13768"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和静久四目相对。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总觉得有种无法用言语述说的不安涌上心头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也不知道这是怎么回事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是……看这几天紬的情况。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明很期待一起出去玩这件事，却总是迟到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"难道说……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"难道说……紬出了什么事？"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i137"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13767"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我们……要不要去她家看看？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13804"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“也好……去看看吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但说到底，这也只是对紬迟到这件事感到不安罢了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以也没能多说什么……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为我感觉……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"自己心中似乎已经承认了那种不安。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i129"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对了，紬的家在哪里来着。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13843"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“唉？我没去过她家。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是这样吗？那么，我们该去哪里好呢……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13840"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这座岛也没那么大，问一问镜子小姐或者其他人，说不定就知道紬的家在哪了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是吗。也对……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13816"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“没错，不用担心……羽依里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，是啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13767"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“如果紬来了这里却一个人都没有也不太好。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13737"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我就这样继续在这里等她吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，那就拜托你了。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i58"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11578"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“羽依里？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那个，镜子阿姨。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11566"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“怎么了，这么早就回来了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那个……你知道紬的家在哪吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11614"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“紬的家？对不起，我不知道哎。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这样啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11566"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“……发生了什么了吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，也没发生什么事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我们自己去找就好了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11578"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“哦，嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我就先走了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11563"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“啊……可能有点小题大做。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11614"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“不过如果真有什么事，可以用岛内广播的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11632"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“和小美希说一下应该就能用了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“有劳你费心了。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i25"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"话虽如此，可我该上哪去找？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是迟到了就用岛内广播，还是有点小题大做了吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总之，去我能想到的地方找找看吧。"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i11"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i44"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……没有。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……好热。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"原本说起来，每次见到紬都是在灯塔前。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"几乎想不到紬还可能在什么地方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉，啊……没有。我想找一个人。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“什么样的人？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那个……金发的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“是不良吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“不要和那种坏孩子一起玩哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是的，不是你说的那种金发孩子。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是个可能在这里买过棉花糖的女孩子。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“啊，那个小姑娘啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“今天你有看到过她吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“没看到过。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这样啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“她走丢了吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是的……只是今天约好见面，她却一直没有来罢了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以，我想去她家找找看。你知道她家在哪里吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“不知道呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这样啊……那么就只能一家一家问问看了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“跟踪狂？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“须藤？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是的。我是加藤家的外孙。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“你是喜欢尾随的人吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我可不是跟踪狂。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“以前也有个………跟踪狂一样的男人。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，好了。这种往事下次再听你讲。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“到处寻找金发女子的……看守灯塔的那个男人。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……唉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"金发女子和……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……看守灯塔的人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“金发女子的父母和那个男人，在岛上到处寻找了不知多少天。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“但是，那孩子……到最后也没出现。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没出现吗……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“听说啊……那孩子可能是神隐了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“神隐？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“这座岛时不时就会发生这种事情。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“某一天某个人突然消失，之后又突然回来了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“但是只有那孩子……至今好像也没有回来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"背上的冷汗不断的流。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那，那个……神隐的孩子的熟人。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……现在还有谁？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“没啦，已经没有了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“知晓那孩子的事的人，加藤是最后一个了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……我的外婆？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不行……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不想再深入思考下去了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"继续往深处分析思考……事情会变得很诡异的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“喜欢棉花糖的那女孩如果来了，我会告诉她你来这里找过她的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……啊。谢谢你……了……”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i427"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没法思考了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不，是我不想再往深处想了……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"脑子一片空白地走着……找着紬的家。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i480"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“羽依里？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i129"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13767"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……静久？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不知道什么时候，我回到了灯塔。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13764"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“找到紬的家了吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“很遗憾，没有……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13807"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这样啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13846"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“但是，肯定没事的♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……是啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13840"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13843"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“羽依里……你的脸色看起来不太好。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13767"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我去接些水回来，你一点一点喝吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……不用了，我自己去接水就好。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13840"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是吗？”"},{"op":"clear","layer":0},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i317"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我走向灯塔侧面的饮水处。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不行。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"都不记得刚才和静久说了什么了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"脑中仿佛一片浆糊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不安与担心，搅成一团……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大脑发热。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啊……"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嘶……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i507"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":" “啊～～～～～～～～～～～～!!” "},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13836"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“唉……羽依里!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"狠狠地将水泼在头上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"现在什么都不想考虑，"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"想要头脑赶紧冷却下来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"想要放声大叫。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也不太清楚到底是怎么回事了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一头钻进装满水的桶里。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":" “啵啵啵啵啵～～～～～～……………………!!!” "},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i129"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“噗哈……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"头脑确实冷却下来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"物理上的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13823"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“清醒了吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……清醒点了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13820"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这样啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13846"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“如果还没有清醒的话，那就再来一次吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不用，没问题了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13816"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“全身都湿透了，口袋里面没事吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……大概不能说没事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"里面还装着钱包之类的东西。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“晾干后就能用了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13834"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“你湿透了呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我把口袋里的东西都翻了出来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"于是…………"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1333"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……唉？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1332"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"翻出了那张照片。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"静久凝视着那张照片。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"竟然……被静久看到了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i129"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13807"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“那个……羽依里。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13804"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这是什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这是之前我在仓库里面发现的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13767"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13764"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我不是在问这个，那个……怎么说好呢……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"静久似乎不知道该怎么说。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"换作我的话，应该也会是这个反应吧。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13807"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1332"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这个，是紬吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“不是和紬相似的某个人……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这是怎么回事？这照片看起来是几十年前的吧……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“这是……怎么回事？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我也不清楚……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就这样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"静久和我沉默了好一会儿。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"时不时瞥一下照片。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"想要说些什么。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是又什么都没有说。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i129"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13764"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“紬……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13767"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“她说自己很快就要‘回去’了是吧……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13807"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我还以为……紬肯定是要回故乡去了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我也……是这么想的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13804"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“但是……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13807"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“她究竟是要回哪里去呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13764"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i508"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接下来的话……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们俩都没能说出口。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为想象到的并不是好事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"按常识来说，这只是和紬相似的某个人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仅此而已。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是这几天的不安，加上紬和照片中的人又是那么的相像……让我难以否认她俩是同一人的想法。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i485"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i134"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13767"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“天快要黑了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"你到底怎么了……紬。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13840"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我说……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13843"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“应该该不会……就这么分别了吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……不会的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那种事不可能发生。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这里只能听到海浪的声音。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那首哼唱的曲子……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……却听不到了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“紬……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i135"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"忽然，我抬头看了一下灯塔。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i136"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……唉？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“静久……那个是？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"灯塔中的电灯打开了。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i133"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13767"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……这是怎么回事？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们一直呆在这里，明明谁都没有进去过。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为什么，灯却亮了起来……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我们进去吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13804"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“嗯……好的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"打开灯塔的门。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后像往常一样，登上台阶……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i489"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“……呜……呜……呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有女孩子……在哭泣。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i139"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是紬……吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i323"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14792"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“呜……呜……啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紬趴在地上……一直在哭。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“紬……怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14790"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“……对……不起……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14747"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我们的约定……呜……我没能遵守。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14790"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“……呜咕……呜……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14792"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“说好一起……出去玩的……我却没有……遵守约定。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14790"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“和你们……都约好了……还拉了钩……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我却……没能……遵守……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i139"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14789"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“紬……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我该说些什么呢？"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14746"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“呜。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14789"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“对不起……对不起……对……不起。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“千根针……我吃千根针……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14791"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“对不起……对不起……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“紬！”"},{"op":"clear","layer":0},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i323"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14792"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13833"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"静久环抱着紬。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14790"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“呜……呜呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“没事的……没事的……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13850"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我们不会因为这样就生你气的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13817"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“对吧，羽依里？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，当然了……紬。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“比起这个……我们不是约好了，这种时候要露出笑容吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不遵守那个约定才会让我受打击。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14747"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“啊……嗯……对不起。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"紬慌忙擦起了眼泪。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“换个时间，我们下次再去不就好了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对吧，静久。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13850"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是啊，不用太放在心上。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13817"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“要不就明天去？还是说后天再去？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i13824"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我很期待呢♪”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14750"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“……啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14747"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“……呜……真是……太好了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14790"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“我还以为……去不成了呢……，要是那样的话……那该怎么办呢？”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i512"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“呜咕……咕……呜唉～～～～～！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“好了，不要再哭的这么伤心了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“太好了……真的是太好了……”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i139"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i14793"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“嘶……嘶……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……睡着了啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13816"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“是啊。应该是哭累了吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一开始还紧紧抱着静久。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后逐渐放松下来了，正常的睡着了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没错，正常地睡。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i323"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14794"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"戳戳小脸。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i14813"},{"op":"text","speaker":"紬","text":"“姆啾……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i139"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嗯，反应很正常。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……正常。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13807"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“我……在这里和羽依里分开后。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13804"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“一直站在灯塔前。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13767"},{"op":"text","speaker":"静久","text":"“没有一个人来过。”"},{"op"